cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and this repository as indicated below."
title: "FluidInclusion AutoTh System: automated fluid inclusion homogenization temperature measurement powered by machine learning and GUI automation"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, CPU-only system for fully automatic homogenization temperature (Th)
  measurement of fluid inclusions. It combines YOLO-based inclusion detection, U-Net++
  gas-liquid semantic segmentation, GUI automation (PyAutoGUI) and inter-process
  communication to drive a commercial Linkam MDSG600 heating stage without a native API,
  and runtime algorithms for automated target re-localization, sharpness-confidence
  auto-focus and stability-window homogenization detection.
